Package: paa-viewer
Version: 0.1.3
Section: graphics
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: omp <omp@localhost>
Description: Bohemia Interactive PAA texture viewer, converter, and POT resizer
 High performance texture viewer and converter for Bohemia Interactive PAA
 textures (Arma 3, DayZ). Features cross-platform GPU-accelerated viewer,
 native GPU GUI interface, Power of Two resizing, and file manager context menu.
